        </enumvalue>
        <enumvalue id="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-runners_1gga913c4161963e9439b20857358486e8b2a99e9bae675b12967251c175696f00a70" prot="public">
          <name>human</name>
          <briefdescription>
          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>The human-readable reporter, with optional colours. </para>
          </detaileddescription>
        </enumvalue>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The built-in reporters. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Selected with the <computeroutput>--reporter</computeroutput> command-line option, or with <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1runner__options_1ad22d04df014c5b0658b6e7bd239f15b0" kindref="member">runner_options::selected_reporter</ref></computeroutput>; the default is <computeroutput>tap</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="since"><para>6.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
